    "updated_at": "2026-11-10T03:36:29Z",
    "body": "**Blocked upstream: `egui_dock` has no egui 0.37 release yet.** Nothing was pushed.\n\n- CamCraft's dock layout (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs`, `layout/mod.rs`) uses `egui_dock =0.21.1`, its newest release. That release depends on `egui ^0.36`, so bumping egui alone would put two eguis in the build.\n- egui 0.37.0 and egui_kittest 0.37.0 are out (2026-10-15). egui_dock's 0.37 support is an **open, unmerged PR, Adanos020/egui_dock#354** (\"Bump egui version to 0.37, fix deprecations\", 2026-10-25).\n\n**Decision:** wait for egui_dock's 0.37 release, then bump all four (`egui`, `egui-winit`, `egui-wgpu`, `egui_kittest` to =0.37.x, `egui_dock` to its matching release) in one PR.\n- **Dropped: a git pin to that PR's branch.** It's unreleased and unreviewed code in the UI's core layout, and AGENTS.md wants a new or unusual dependency source decided by the maintainer.\n- **Dropped: replacing `egui_dock`.** That's a far bigger change than this issue.\n\n**Next step:** recheck when egui_dock publishes 0.22 (or whatever version targets egui 0.37). This blocks #659 and #655.\n\nunclaim",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
